        "Content": "Key Features\r\n\r\nA2‑rated, energy‑efficient home — exceptionally rare in Dublin 7\r\nRecently constructed (Built in 2022)\r\nEnd‑of‑terrace corner site with dual‑aspect brick elevation and freshly painted render\r\n153 sq.m / 1,648 sq.ft over three floors\r\n4 bedrooms, including attic double bedroom with shower room\r\nTriple‑glazed windows and doors\r\nAir‑to‑water heat pump\r\nBespoke fitted kitchen with extended work surfaces\r\nLarge dine‑in kitchen / living area.\r\nWrap‑around landscaped rear garden\r\nBroad side entrance—rare for the area\r\nUtility room + ground floor shower room\r\nPrincipal bedroom with walk‑in wardrobe and ensuite\r\nQuality paved driveway with off‑street parking\r\nPotential for solar panels and EV charging\r\nCabra Gate entrance to Phoenix Park — 400m\r\nNavan Road (R147) — 130m, with direct access to M50 (5km)\r\nN2 orbital bus stop directly outside the door\r\nBus routes 37, 38, 39, 70, 122\r\n20‑minute walk to Broombridge Luas & Commuter Rail\r\nCity centre 4–5km | Dublin Airport 12km\r\nMater Hospital & Connolly Hospital Blanchardstown are nearby\r\nSchools, Aura Leisure Centre, and Inspire Leisure Centre nearby\r\nFreehold title"
